        503.64422607421875
      ],
      "text": "No comparison with 6 months of isoniazid. The study included 2.7% HIV-positive participants. Although the trial was conducted in low TB incidence countries, this is unlikely to affect relative effect of rifapentine + isoniazid  a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
