    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        66.61430358886719,
        503.0442199707031,
        276.1170654296875,
        512.6442260742188
      ],
      "text": "compared with isoniazid monotherapy. Downgraded by one level.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69309997558594,
        509.0442199707031,
        634.3920288085938,
        521.6442260742188
      ],
      "text": "Although the 95% CI of RR is wide, the number of events was small and the CI of absolute effect is narrow. The result also met pre-stated non-inferiority margin. Not downgraded.  b",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
