        462.4410400390625,
        530.6442260742188
      ],
      "text": "Although the 95% CI of RR is wide, the number of events was small and the CI of absolute effect is narrow. Not downgraded.  c",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
